          <div style="background: var(--color-surface-alt); padding: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
            <div style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
              <span>Google News</span>
              <span class="badge badge-green">PASS</span>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.5;">
              NewsArticle schema injected, IST publication timestamps compliant.
